        "text": "<p>Refresh your FANY Luna smartwatch with stylish replacement watch bands designed for women. Explore soft silicone, classic leather, and decorative bracelet-style bands to match your personal style and daily routine. With a 16mm quick-release design, compatible FANY Luna bands are easy to switch without tools, making it simple to refresh your look from everyday wear to special occasions.</p>",
