        "text_dBNPre": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Choose Silicone for Everyday Comfort</h3><p>A silicone watch band offers a casual, sporty look for everyday activities and active routines. It is a versatile choice if you prefer a relaxed style.</p><h3>Choose Leather for Timeless Style</h3><p>A leather watch band adds a classic, polished finish that pairs well with workwear, everyday outfits, and more formal occasions.</p><h3>Choose a Bracelet-Style Band for a Statement Look</h3><p>Decorative bracelet-style watch bands add sparkle and personality to your smartwatch. Choose a crystal or mother-of-pearl design when you want your watch to complement your outfit or stand out as an accessory.</p><h3>Check Compatibility Before Buying</h3><p>FANY Luna replacement bands use a 16mm quick-release connection and are designed for the FANY Luna smartwatch. Check the product specifications before ordering to ensure a compatible fit.</p>",
